# Do not deploy to Lodestone

Live Minecraft host is Apex (`g-pl-3.apexnodes.xyz:21561`). Players get mods from the CDN pack via the AquaTech launcher.

## Do not

- Run `python tools/sync_lodestone_mods.py`
- Copy `aquatech_ui` / `casesmod` / `packetfixer` / kubejs / config into `%USERPROFILE%\.lodestone\instances\AquaTech-*\`
- Restart Mohist in Lodestone as part of a release

`publish_client_pack.py` must not call the Lodestone helper.

Optional local testing against a Lodestone instance is manual and out of the release path.
